# tilltotal

Order totals for tilltotal, all in integer cents.

Order of operations: a percentage coupon is taken off the subtotal first, then tax is charged on the discounted subtotal. Tax is never charged on money the customer did not pay. Shipping is added last, after tax, and is never taxed.

## Checkout

computeTotal({ subtotal, couponPercent, taxPercent, shipping }) returns the order total in cents.

## Shipping

shippingFor(subtotal) is free at or above the threshold, a flat fee below it. Free shipping is decided on the pre-coupon subtotal.

